            "1 ’King o! ’rah lev khwan ching ruh )}3",
            "Kauh thangc thuanhpui lu suan e:",
            "Zian thaymei Jisu guanghtu the,",
            "Tingkauhmei guay neihlaa e;",
            "Zauc lo, guanghbamv khou dungcna",
